Empirical model
We model a farmer’s WTP for IBF using a single-equation logit model of the form:
Yi = β0+ βiXi + ɛj
where Y is a binary variable for farmers’ WTP (having value of one if farmers are willing to pay for IBF and zero otherwise), i indexes individual farmer’s WTP, β0 is the intercept, βi is the regression coefficient, X is a vector of explanatory variables that affect farmers’ WTP, ɛj is an error term, which assumes a normal distribution (mean = 0,


