Materials and methods
Origin of H. illucens population and colony maintenance
A stock culture of the wild-caught fly population was established following the methodology described by (Booth & Sheppard, 1984) and (Sripontan et al., 2017) with slight modifications. Egg-trapping of wild BSF was carried out in Kasarani, Nairobi County, Kenya (S 01 ̊ 13’ 14.6’’; E 036 ̊ 53’ 44.5’’, 1612 m above sea level). Chicken manure, rabbit


